# Frontend Decoupled Environment Variables
# In development (with Vite proxy), leave empty or set to /api/v1
# In standalone production deployment (e.g. Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages), point to your Backend API domain:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1
